@0:02-0:04.5 img:light ken:push fade
@0:04.5-0:10 img:child ken:up
vo: Before anything was made, there was love.
@0:10-0:15 img:steps ken:down fx:flare
vo: Not a little. Not enough. Overflowing.
+2.5 title: OVERFLOWING
@0:15-0:21 img:turn ken:in
vo: For the lost. For the misguided.
vo: For the ones who would wound Him.
@0:21-0:25 img:smile ken:still hold:silent
