# ACT TWO · WARNING
@0:38-0:44 img:market ken:left cue:tense,0.7
vo: But hear what He said about the little ones.
@0:44-0:50 img:kneel ken:in
vo: "Whoever causes one of these little ones to stumble..."
ref: Matthew 18:6
@0:50-0:56 img:millstone ken:down
vo: "...better for them to have a millstone hung around their neck,
vo: and to be drowned in the depths of the sea."
@0:56-1:00 black hold:silent
@1:00-1:06 img:door ken:push cue:tense,1
vo: "Not everyone who says to me, 'Lord, Lord'...
vo: I never knew you."
ref: Matthew 7:21–23
@1:06-1:08 drop:"The truth will set you free" ref:"John 8:32"

# ACT THREE · CORDS
@1:08-1:12 img:temple ken:right cue:build
text: Do not bargain with darkness.
@1:12-1:15.75 img:take ken:in
text: Drive it out.
@1:15.75-1:20.5 cuts:cords,knot,knot!,eyes,braid,whip cue:none
audio: ../assets/audio/home-braid-1.mp3 gain -4db until 1:26 fade 0.6
text: He made a whip of cords.
ref: John 2:15
@1:20.5-1:26 img:tables ken:slow hit:2
vo: "...and drove them all out of His Father's house."
@1:26-1:31 img:doves ken:up fx:flare
audio: ../assets/audio/home-choir-1.mp3 gain -2db until 1:37.8 fade 1.5
text: We do not fight people.
text: We fight for them.
@1:31-1:34 img:whipfloor ken:still
@1:34-1:38 img:child ken:up
title: Love is not weak.
@1:38-1:40 drop:"Take heart. I have overcome the world." ref:"John 16:33"

# ACT FOUR · WITNESS
@1:40-1:47 img:weep ken:slow cue:weep
audio: ../assets/audio/home-weep-1.mp3 gain -9db
vo: He wept over the city,
vo: because it did not recognize the time of God's coming.
ref: Luke 19:41–44
@1:47-1:49 img:stone ken:push hit:2
@1:49-1:54 img:ruins ken:left
vo: "Not one stone will be left on another."
ref: Matthew 24:2 · 70 AD
@1:54-2:00 img:redsea ken:in cue:drone,0.8
sfx: braam
vo: "The Lord will fight for you. You need only to be still."
ref: Exodus 14:14

# ACT FIVE · VOW
@2:00-2:14 img:grown ken:in cue:drone,0.5
audio: ../assets/audio/home-heart-1.mp3 gain 3db until 2:14 fade 0.5
text: I will not fear.
text: Fear makes the soul small.
text: Let it come.
text: Let it pass through me.
text: Only He remains.
@2:14-2:17 img:eyesopen ken:still hold:silent
@2:17-2:24 img:stand ken:up fx:rise cue:tutti
vo: "Do not fear, for I am with you...
vo: I will uphold you with my righteous right hand."
ref: Isaiah 41:10
@2:24-2:27 img:dawn ken:push hit:2
audio: ../assets/audio/home-final-1.mp3 gain -3db
title: So stand.
@2:27-2:31 img:opendoor ken:in fade cue:outro
text: You were never forced.
text: You were invited.
@2:31-2:36 black
title: Do not be afraid.
